        "slc_d2485127dc4e5b760349e57bb404d533422616d3b812db66afd7a957ed350eb7"
      ],
      "text": "pi-reflect provides iterative self-improvement for pi coding agents: it reads recent conversations and reference material, compares actual behavior against a defined target, and edits the target file to close the gap."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_519cca9eab04a2918c1d6c6249b735d83f59394dc4e7ad4c9ce1f0ad174862c7",
